309 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 255 0 R
/T (At Vishwakarma University, student welfare is a top priority, ensuring holistic development, academic support, and a vibrant campus life. In alignment with the Student Council, various initiatives and facilities are designed to enhance students' well-being, engagement, and success. The Student Council acts as a bridge between students and the administration, organizing cultural, academic, and social events, addressing student concerns, promoting mental well-being, and encouraging extracurricular involvement through clubs and sports activities. Student welfare at Vishwakarma University is a shared responsibility between the administration and the Student Council, ensuring a thriving academic and social experience. By focusing on academic support, mental health, extracurricular engagement, and career development, the university fosters an environment where students grow into well-rounded individuals ready to excel in their respective fields.)
/E (At Vishwakarma University, student welfare is a top priority, ensuring holistic development, academic support, and a vibrant campus life. In alignment with the Student Council, various initiatives and facilities are designed to enhance students' well-being, engagement, and success. The Student Council acts as a bridge between students and the administration, organizing cultural, academic, and social events, addressing student concerns, promoting mental well-being, and encouraging extracurricular involvement through clubs and sports activities. Student welfare at Vishwakarma University is a shared responsibility between the administration and the Student Council, ensuring a thriving academic and social experience. By focusing on academic support, mental health, extracurricular engagement, and career development, the university fosters an environment where students grow into well-rounded individuals ready to excel in their respective fields.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
